sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Driver as Assigned Driver (WA)
    participant CRM as CRM Billing & Ledger Engine
    actor Customer as Customer (WA)
    actor Admin as Admin Staff

    Note over Driver,Customer: On assignment
    CRM->>Customer: Trip OTP (only its hash is stored)

    Note over Driver,CRM: At Pickup Time
    Driver->>CRM: Taps [ Start Trip ]
    CRM->>Driver: "Ask the customer for their trip OTP"
    Customer-->>Driver: Shares OTP in the cab
    Driver->>CRM: Types OTP
    alt Wrong OTP (limited attempts)
        CRM->>Driver: "Wrong OTP, N attempts left" / locked → customer replies OTP for a new code
    else Correct OTP
        CRM->>CRM: TRIP_IN_PROGRESS, trip_started_at
        CRM->>Customer: "Your trip with BiharCabs has started! Have a safe journey."
    end

    Note over Driver,CRM: At Drop-Off / Trip Completion
    Driver->>CRM: Taps [ Complete Trip ] (only possible after an OTP start)
    CRM->>CRM: Cash collected by driver = Fare − Advance confirmed by Razorpay<br/>(extra km / toll entry not collected by the bot yet)
    CRM->>CRM: Driver net = (Fare − BiharCabs share) − Cash collected<br/>= Advance − share on advance rides (owed to driver)<br/>= −share on full-cash rides (owed by driver)
    CRM->>CRM: BiharCabs share = commission (Settings take-rate) + GST on it + tech fee<br/>Rolling reserve / streak bonus applied, wallet & ledger updated in one transaction
    CRM->>Customer: Trip completed message with total and invoice number, then 1-tap rating buttons
    CRM->>Driver: Settlement summary: fare, advance held by BiharCabs, cash collected,<br/>commission, "this trip: ₹X owed to you / to BiharCabs", wallet balance

